/* Задание 37: 62 письма из Открытого банка заданий ЕГЭ (ФИПИ), разбор вопросов; образцы ответов составлены для сайта. */
window.W37=[{"g":"her","topic":"School","id":1,"name":"Sally","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"Summer is coming and I decided to lose weight.","q":[{"t":"How many PE classes a week do Russian teenagers have at school?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What do they do during those classes?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"Where do teenagers spend their free time?","k":"country","d":false}],"about":"the photo album","trig":"I’ve found my Grandma’s photo album in the garage","tt":"past","ans":["Russian teenagers usually have two or three PE classes a week, depending on the school.","During these lessons, they play team games, run, do exercises and sometimes pass fitness tests.","In their free time, teenagers often meet friends, go to shopping centres, do sport or just relax online."],"ask":["Where did you find the photo album?","Whose old photos are there?","Which photo is the most interesting for you?"],"model":"Dear Sally,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Russian teenagers usually have two or three PE classes a week, depending on the school. During these lessons, they play team games, run, do exercises and sometimes pass fitness tests. In their free time, teenagers often meet friends, go to shopping centres, do sport or just relax online.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the photo album. Where did you find the photo album? Whose old photos are there? Which photo is the most interesting for you?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Travelling","id":2,"name":"Jasper","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"My friends have just come back from a trip to Africa. It’s been my dream for years!","q":[{"t":"What is your dream trip, where would you like to go and why?","k":"would","d":true},{"t":"Whom would you like to take with you?","k":"would","d":false},{"t":"What is the most difficult thing for you when you travel?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"his sister","trig":"My sister is getting married","tt":"future","ans":["My dream trip is to Japan because I would love to see Tokyo, Kyoto and traditional temples.","I would take my best friend with me, as we enjoy discovering new places together.","The most difficult thing for me when I travel is planning everything carefully and not forgetting important documents."],"ask":["When is your sister getting married?","Where will the wedding take place?","Are you going to help with the preparations?"],"model":"Dear Jasper,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. My dream trip is to Japan because I would love to see Tokyo, Kyoto and traditional temples. I would take my best friend with me, as we enjoy discovering new places together. The most difficult thing for me when I travel is planning everything carefully and not forgetting important documents.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your sister. When is your sister getting married? Where will the wedding take place? Are you going to help with the preparations?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Visit to Russia","id":3,"name":"Victoria","email":true,"subject":"","lead":"My parents and I want to take a tour across Russia next summer. We need your advice.","q":[{"t":"What cities should we visit, why these?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"Is it better to travel by rail or by air in Russia?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What is the weather like in summer?","k":"country","d":false}],"about":"the exam","trig":"I’ve passed my Spanish exam!","tt":"past","ans":["I think you should visit Moscow and St. Petersburg because they have famous museums, beautiful architecture and a lot of history.","Travelling by rail is usually better if you want to see more of the country, but flying is faster for long distances.","In summer the weather in Russia can be warm and sunny, though it may change quickly."],"ask":["Was the Spanish exam difficult?","How long did you prepare for it?","What mark did you get?"],"model":"Dear Victoria,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I think you should visit Moscow and St. Petersburg because they have famous museums, beautiful architecture and a lot of history. Travelling by rail is usually better if you want to see more of the country, but flying is faster for long distances. In summer the weather in Russia can be warm and sunny, though it may change quickly.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the exam. Was the Spanish exam difficult? How long did you prepare for it? What mark did you get?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Zoos and animals","id":4,"name":"Susan","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"Yesterday I went to the zoo.","q":[{"t":"What are the benefits of zoos in your opinion?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Do you think there should be a zoo in every city and why?","k":"opinion","d":true},{"t":"Is it better to keep wild animals in natural reserves than in cages and why?","k":"opinion","d":true}],"about":"the dog","trig":"By the way, I’ve taken a dog from a dog shelter","tt":"past","ans":["In my opinion, zoos can protect rare animals and teach people more about wildlife.","I do not think every city needs a zoo because animals need enough space and good care.","Natural reserves are better for wild animals because they live in a more natural environment and have more freedom."],"ask":["What is your dog’s name?","How old is it?","Was it difficult to take it from the shelter?"],"model":"Dear Susan,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. In my opinion, zoos can protect rare animals and teach people more about wildlife. I do not think every city needs a zoo because animals need enough space and good care. Natural reserves are better for wild animals because they live in a more natural environment and have more freedom.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the dog. What is your dog’s name? How old is it? Was it difficult to take it from the shelter?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Animal protection","id":5,"name":"Harry","email":true,"subject":"Animal protection","lead":"Last month our class went to the zoo to find out about the animal conservation programme.","q":[{"t":"Are there any endangered animals in Russia and what are these?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"Do you consider helping animals important, why or why not?","k":"opinion","d":true},{"t":"What can people do to help endangered species?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the novel","trig":"I’ve just finished reading an interesting novel","tt":"past","ans":["Yes, there are endangered animals in Russia, such as Amur tigers and snow leopards.","I consider helping animals important because people are responsible for many environmental problems.","People can donate money, support nature reserves and avoid buying products that harm wildlife."],"ask":["What is the novel about?","Who is the main character?","Would you recommend this novel to me?"],"model":"Dear Harry,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you, and I hope you are doing well.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Yes, there are endangered animals in Russia, such as Amur tigers and snow leopards. I consider helping animals important because people are responsible for many environmental problems. People can donate money, support nature reserves and avoid buying products that harm wildlife.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the novel. What is the novel about? Who is the main character? Would you recommend this novel to me?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Internet","id":6,"name":"Charles","email":true,"subject":"Internet","lead":"My parents gave me a laptop for my birthday.","q":[{"t":"What do you use the Internet for?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What do you usually download from the Internet?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Is it popular with Russian teenagers to have their own blogs or websites, why or why not?","k":"country","d":true}],"about":"the school trip","trig":"Yesterday I went with my class on a school trip to the capital","tt":"past","ans":["I use the Internet for studying, watching videos, chatting with friends and looking for useful information.","I usually download films, music and study materials when I need them for school.","Having blogs is quite popular with Russian teenagers because they like sharing their opinions, hobbies and photos."],"ask":["Where did you go on your school trip?","How long did the trip last?","What impressed you most in the capital?"],"model":"Dear Charles,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I use the Internet for studying, watching videos, chatting with friends and looking for useful information. I usually download films, music and study materials when I need them for school. Having blogs is quite popular with Russian teenagers because they like sharing their opinions, hobbies and photos.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the school trip. Where did you go on your school trip? How long did the trip last? What impressed you most in the capital?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Local culture","id":7,"name":"Simon","email":true,"subject":"","lead":"Yesterday there was a local crafts festival in my region. It was incredible!","q":[{"t":"What cultural events are held in your region?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"How often do you visit such local events?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Do you think it is important for teenagers to take part in local cultural events, and why?","k":"opinion","d":true}],"about":"the film","trig":"I’ve just finished watching an interesting film","tt":"past","ans":["In my region, concerts, exhibitions, fairs and festivals are often held in parks or cultural centres.","I visit such events several times a year, especially when my friends invite me.","I think teenagers should take part in local cultural events because it helps them understand their traditions better."],"ask":["What is the film about?","Who played the main role?","Did you like the ending?"],"model":"Dear Simon,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. In my region, concerts, exhibitions, fairs and festivals are often held in parks or cultural centres. I visit such events several times a year, especially when my friends invite me. I think teenagers should take part in local cultural events because it helps them understand their traditions better.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the film. What is the film about? Who played the main role? Did you like the ending?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Hobbies and pastimes","id":8,"name":"Harry","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"At school we are doing an interesting project on the most popular pastimes with teenagers.","q":[{"t":"What are the top leisure activities among Russian teenagers?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What hobby do you have, if any at all?","k":"habit","d":true},{"t":"Do you think it is important for friends or relatives to share one’s hobby, and why or why not?","k":"opinion","d":true}],"about":"his brother","trig":"As for the latest news, my brother has won a tennis tournament","tt":"past","ans":["The top leisure activities among Russian teenagers are listening to music, watching films, playing sport and spending time online.","My hobby is reading and learning English because it helps me relax and improve my skills.","I think friends and relatives do not have to share one hobby, but common interests can make relationships warmer."],"ask":["What tournament did your brother win?","How long has he played tennis?","How did your family celebrate his victory?"],"model":"Dear Harry,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. The top leisure activities among Russian teenagers are listening to music, watching films, playing sport and spending time online. My hobby is reading and learning English because it helps me relax and improve my skills. I think friends and relatives do not have to share one hobby, but common interests can make relationships warmer.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your brother. What tournament did your brother win? How long has he played tennis? How did your family celebrate his victory?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Hobby","id":9,"name":"Mike","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I’ve got new hobbies – recording birds’ songs and taking pictures of wild life.","q":[{"t":"What hobby do you have?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"How much time do you spend on it?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What do your parents and friends think of your hobby?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"his elder brother","trig":"Hooray! My elder brother promised to be back home from college on my birthday","tt":"future","ans":["My hobby is taking photos, especially of nature and city streets.","I spend about two or three hours a week on it when I have free time.","My parents and friends support my hobby because it is creative and helps me notice beautiful things around me."],"ask":["When will your elder brother come home?","Does he study far from home?","What will you do together on your birthday?"],"model":"Dear Mike,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. My hobby is taking photos, especially of nature and city streets. I spend about two or three hours a week on it when I have free time. My parents and friends support my hobby because it is creative and helps me notice beautiful things around me.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your elder brother. When will your elder brother come home? Does he study far from home? What will you do together on your birthday?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Hobbies","id":10,"name":"Lily","email":true,"subject":"Hobbies","lead":"Many of my friends enjoy roller-skating in their free time, and I like it too.","q":[{"t":"How do you and your friends spend free time in your region?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"Which hobbies are popular with teens in Russia?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What new hobby would you like to try in the future, and why this one?","k":"would","d":true}],"about":"the youth camp","trig":"Last week I returned from a sports youth camp","tt":"past","ans":["My friends and I usually spend our free time walking, going to the cinema or playing sports.","Many Russian teenagers enjoy dancing, gaming, blogging, drawing and doing sport.","I would like to try rock climbing because it looks exciting and develops courage."],"ask":["Where was the sports youth camp?","How long did you stay there?","What activities did you enjoy most?"],"model":"Dear Lily,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. My friends and I usually spend our free time walking, going to the cinema or playing sports. Many Russian teenagers enjoy dancing, gaming, blogging, drawing and doing sport. I would like to try rock climbing because it looks exciting and develops courage.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the youth camp. Where was the sports youth camp? How long did you stay there? What activities did you enjoy most?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Ecotourism","id":11,"name":"George","email":true,"subject":"Ecotourism","lead":"In the modern world ecotourism has become a popular way to spend holidays.","q":[{"t":"What is your attitude to ecotourism?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Is it popular in your country, why or why not?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"What new opportunities does ecotourism offer?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the youth camp","trig":"By the way, I’ve just returned from a youth camp","tt":"past","ans":["I have a positive attitude to ecotourism because it allows people to travel and respect nature at the same time.","It is becoming more popular in Russia because many people want quiet holidays away from big cities.","Ecotourism offers opportunities to see wild nature, learn about local culture and support small communities."],"ask":["Where was the youth camp?","What did you do there?","Did you make any new friends?"],"model":"Dear George,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I have a positive attitude to ecotourism because it allows people to travel and respect nature at the same time. It is becoming more popular in Russia because many people want quiet holidays away from big cities. Ecotourism offers opportunities to see wild nature, learn about local culture and support small communities.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the youth camp. Where was the youth camp? What did you do there? Did you make any new friends?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Birthday","id":12,"name":"Ella","email":true,"subject":"Birthday","lead":"I’ve checked my diary and found out that I missed your birthday. I’m so sorry about that! I hope you enjoyed it this year!","q":[{"t":"Which birthday gifts are popular in Russia?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"How do you usually celebrate your birthday?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What is the best gift you’ve ever got?","k":"past","d":false}],"about":"her trip to London","trig":"I’m going to visit my friends in London soon","tt":"future","ans":["Popular birthday gifts in Russia are gadgets, books, cosmetics, clothes and gift cards.","I usually celebrate my birthday with my family first and then meet my friends.","The best gift I have ever got was a camera because it helped me start a new hobby."],"ask":["When are you going to London?","Who are you going to visit there?","What places would you like to see?"],"model":"Dear Ella,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Popular birthday gifts in Russia are gadgets, books, cosmetics, clothes and gift cards. I usually celebrate my birthday with my family first and then meet my friends. The best gift I have ever got was a camera because it helped me start a new hobby.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your trip to London. When are you going to London? Who are you going to visit there? What places would you like to see?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Weather","id":13,"name":"Jerry","email":true,"subject":"Weather","lead":"This year the weather in winter was unusually cold.","q":[{"t":"What about the weather in your region this winter?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What do you do when it is snowing heavily?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What is your favourite season, why?","k":"habit","d":true}],"about":"his trip to London","trig":"I’ve just returned from a trip to London","tt":"past","ans":["This winter in my region was rather cold and snowy, especially in January.","When it is snowing heavily, I usually stay at home, drink hot tea and watch films.","My favourite season is spring because the weather becomes warmer and nature looks fresh again."],"ask":["How long did your trip to London last?","What was the weather like there?","What sights did you visit?"],"model":"Dear Jerry,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. This winter in my region was rather cold and snowy, especially in January. When it is snowing heavily, I usually stay at home, drink hot tea and watch films. My favourite season is spring because the weather becomes warmer and nature looks fresh again.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your trip to London. How long did your trip to London last? What was the weather like there? What sights did you visit?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Online shopping","id":14,"name":"Olivia","email":true,"subject":"Online shopping","lead":"Most of my friends prefer shopping online today.","q":[{"t":"What kind of shopping do you prefer?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Is online shopping popular in your country, and why or why not?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"What are the possible risks of shopping online?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"her school exams","trig":"I’ve passed all my school exams at last","tt":"past","ans":["I prefer online shopping because it is quick and there is usually a wider choice of goods.","Online shopping is popular in Russia because people can compare prices and order things from home.","The main risks are late delivery, poor quality and unsafe payment websites."],"ask":["Which exams did you pass?","Which exam was the most difficult?","How did you celebrate the end of exams?"],"model":"Dear Olivia,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I prefer online shopping because it is quick and there is usually a wider choice of goods. Online shopping is popular in Russia because people can compare prices and order things from home. The main risks are late delivery, poor quality and unsafe payment websites.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your school exams. Which exams did you pass? Which exam was the most difficult? How did you celebrate the end of exams?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Shopping","id":15,"name":"Jane","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I went shopping with my parents yesterday.","q":[{"t":"Do you prefer to shop online or in regular stores?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Why do you think many people like to spend their week-ends in big shopping malls?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Do you like to go shopping on your own or with friends and why?","k":"habit","d":true}],"about":"her birthday celebration","trig":"You know, I celebrated my birthday last week","tt":"past","ans":["I prefer shopping online because it saves time, but I buy shoes and clothes in regular stores.","Many people spend weekends in shopping malls because they can shop, eat out and watch films in one place.","I like shopping with friends because they can give honest advice."],"ask":["Where did you celebrate your birthday?","Who came to the party?","What presents did you get?"],"model":"Dear Jane,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I prefer shopping online because it saves time, but I buy shoes and clothes in regular stores. Many people spend weekends in shopping malls because they can shop, eat out and watch films in one place. I like shopping with friends because they can give honest advice.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your birthday celebration. Where did you celebrate your birthday? Who came to the party? What presents did you get?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Summer holidays","id":16,"name":"Lily","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"School is over! Holidays are looming on the horizon, hurrah!","q":[{"t":"Where do Russian teenagers spend their summer holidays?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What entertainment is popular among them?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"How do you prefer to spend your free time?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"her school-leaving exams","trig":"I took all my final exams last week","tt":"past","ans":["Russian teenagers spend their summer holidays at home, at the seaside, in camps or at their grandparents’ dachas.","Popular entertainment includes swimming, cycling, playing games, going to the cinema and meeting friends.","I prefer to spend my free time outdoors because it helps me relax after school."],"ask":["Which school-leaving exams did you take?","Were they difficult?","How did you feel after the exams?"],"model":"Dear Lily,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Russian teenagers spend their summer holidays at home, at the seaside, in camps or at their grandparents’ dachas. Popular entertainment includes swimming, cycling, playing games, going to the cinema and meeting friends. I prefer to spend my free time outdoors because it helps me relax after school.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your school-leaving exams. Which school-leaving exams did you take? Were they difficult? How did you feel after the exams?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Holidays","id":17,"name":"Jessica","email":true,"subject":"Holidays","lead":"Hurrah! Summer is finally here.","q":[{"t":"Do you spend your summer holidays with your family or your friends?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Where do you usually spend your holidays?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Why do you think some people enjoy spending holidays where they live?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the exams","trig":"My brother Tim has just passed his exams","tt":"past","ans":["I usually spend my summer holidays with my family, but I also meet my friends quite often.","Most often, I spend my holidays at home or at my grandparents’ dacha.","Some people enjoy staying where they live because it is cheaper and they can rest without long journeys."],"ask":["Which exams has Tim passed?","Did he get good results?","How did your family celebrate his success?"],"model":"Dear Jessica,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I usually spend my summer holidays with my family, but I also meet my friends quite often. Most often, I spend my holidays at home or at my grandparents’ dacha. Some people enjoy staying where they live because it is cheaper and they can rest without long journeys.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the exams. Which exams has Tim passed? Did he get good results? How did your family celebrate his success?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Healthy lifestyle","id":18,"name":"Sammy","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"Summer is coming and my sister has decided to lose weight.","q":[{"t":"Do Russian teenagers lead a healthy lifestyle, why or why not?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"What sports and games are popular among them?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"How do teenagers spend their free time?","k":"country","d":false}],"about":"his plans for the winter holidays","trig":"I’m planning my winter holidays","tt":"future","ans":["Some Russian teenagers lead a healthy lifestyle, but others do not because they spend too much time online.","Football, basketball, volleyball, swimming and skating are popular among them.","Teenagers usually spend free time with friends, at sports clubs, in parks or on the Internet."],"ask":["Where are you planning to go for your winter holidays?","Who will travel with you?","What activities are you going to try?"],"model":"Dear Sammy,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Some Russian teenagers lead a healthy lifestyle, but others do not because they spend too much time online. Football, basketball, volleyball, swimming and skating are popular among them. Teenagers usually spend free time with friends, at sports clubs, in parks or on the Internet.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your plans for the winter holidays. Where are you planning to go for your winter holidays? Who will travel with you? What activities are you going to try?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Healthy lifestyle and weight","id":19,"name":"Alice","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I’ve decided to go on a diet – I want to lose a few pounds.","q":[{"t":"What are the most efficient ways to lose weight, in your opinion?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Why do many people try to follow a healthy lifestyle?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"How important is your family’s support if you choose a healthy lifestyle as your goal?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the new film","trig":"Yesterday my friends and I went to the cinema to watch a new film","tt":"past","ans":["The most efficient ways to lose weight are eating balanced meals, doing regular exercise and sleeping enough.","Many people follow a healthy lifestyle because they want to feel energetic and avoid illnesses.","Family support is very important because it is easier to keep healthy habits together."],"ask":["What was the new film about?","Who did you go to the cinema with?","Did you like the film?"],"model":"Dear Alice,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. The most efficient ways to lose weight are eating balanced meals, doing regular exercise and sleeping enough. Many people follow a healthy lifestyle because they want to feel energetic and avoid illnesses. Family support is very important because it is easier to keep healthy habits together.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the new film. What was the new film about? Who did you go to the cinema with? Did you like the film?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Health in winter","id":20,"name":"Olivia","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I know it’s often cold in Russia in winter.","q":[{"t":"What do you usually do not to catch a cold?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What is a healthy lifestyle for you?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"How can you catch up with the class if you do fall ill?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"her cousin","trig":"My cousin is coming to stay with us for Thanksgiving","tt":"future","ans":["Not to catch a cold, I wear warm clothes, drink hot tea and try to sleep enough.","For me, a healthy lifestyle means regular exercise, balanced food and less stress.","If I fall ill, I can catch up with the class by asking classmates for notes and doing homework online."],"ask":["When is your cousin coming?","How long will he stay with you?","What are you going to do together?"],"model":"Dear Olivia,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Not to catch a cold, I wear warm clothes, drink hot tea and try to sleep enough. For me, a healthy lifestyle means regular exercise, balanced food and less stress. If I fall ill, I can catch up with the class by asking classmates for notes and doing homework online.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your cousin. When is your cousin coming? How long will he stay with you? What are you going to do together?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Volunteering","id":21,"name":"Mike","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"Last weekend I volunteered for a local event helping the elderly people.","q":[{"t":"Have you ever participated in any volunteer projects?","k":"past","d":false},{"t":"What are you ready to do to help the local community, if at all?","k":"habit","d":true},{"t":"Do you consider volunteer work important for teenagers, and why or why not?","k":"opinion","d":true}],"about":"the present","trig":"Yesterday my friend got an unusual present","tt":"past","ans":["Yes, I have participated in a volunteer project at school, where we collected clothes and books for people in need.","I am ready to clean parks, help elderly neighbours and take part in charity events.","I think volunteering is important for teenagers because it teaches kindness and responsibility."],"ask":["What present did your friend get?","Who gave it to him?","Why was it unusual?"],"model":"Dear Mike,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Yes, I have participated in a volunteer project at school, where we collected clothes and books for people in need. I am ready to clean parks, help elderly neighbours and take part in charity events. I think volunteering is important for teenagers because it teaches kindness and responsibility.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the present. What present did your friend get? Who gave it to him? Why was it unusual?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Volunteering and environment","id":22,"name":"Nancy","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"We’ve volunteered to plant trees in the park.","q":[{"t":"Is volunteering popular in Russia today, why yes or no?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"What environmental issues do teenagers discuss today?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What do you do to help our planet?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"her uncle","trig":"My uncle has come to visit us","tt":"present","ans":["Volunteering is becoming more popular in Russia because many young people want to be useful.","Teenagers often discuss pollution, climate change, rubbish and endangered animals.","I help our planet by saving water, recycling paper and using reusable bags."],"ask":["When did your uncle come to visit you?","How long will he stay?","What are you going to do together?"],"model":"Dear Nancy,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you, and I hope you are doing well.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Volunteering is becoming more popular in Russia because many young people want to be useful. Teenagers often discuss pollution, climate change, rubbish and endangered animals. I help our planet by saving water, recycling paper and using reusable bags.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your uncle. When did your uncle come to visit you? How long will he stay? What are you going to do together?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Souvenirs","id":23,"name":"Nick","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"My elder brother has just come back from Peru and brought lots of souvenirs. Most of them are quite useless.","q":[{"t":"What kind of things do you consider nice souvenirs?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Why do you think people buy souvenirs at all?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"What do you do with the ones you don’t like?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"his translation","trig":"I have finished translating a book","tt":"past","ans":["I consider postcards, local sweets, magnets and handmade things nice souvenirs because they remind people of a place.","People buy souvenirs to keep memories of their trips and bring something small to friends.","If I do not like a souvenir, I usually keep it in a box or give it to someone who may enjoy it."],"ask":["What book have you finished translating?","Was it difficult to translate?","Are you going to publish your translation?"],"model":"Dear Nick,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I consider postcards, local sweets, magnets and handmade things nice souvenirs because they remind people of a place. People buy souvenirs to keep memories of their trips and bring something small to friends. If I do not like a souvenir, I usually keep it in a box or give it to someone who may enjoy it.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your translation. What book have you finished translating? Was it difficult to translate? Are you going to publish your translation?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Children","id":24,"name":"Emily","email":true,"subject":"Children","lead":"Next weekend my aunt is coming to my place together with all her children.","q":[{"t":"What did you enjoy doing as a child?","k":"past","d":false},{"t":"What was your favourite toy when you were a child?","k":"past","d":false},{"t":"Do you think it is better for children to live in the city or in the countryside?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the changes she made in her room","trig":"Last month I made some changes to the decoration of my room","tt":"past","ans":["As a child, I enjoyed drawing, playing outdoors and inventing games with my friends.","My favourite toy was a soft teddy bear because I took it everywhere with me.","I think the countryside is better for small children, as they have more space and fresh air."],"ask":["What changes did you make in your room?","Did you choose the colours yourself?","Do you like the result?"],"model":"Dear Emily,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. As a child, I enjoyed drawing, playing outdoors and inventing games with my friends. My favourite toy was a soft teddy bear because I took it everywhere with me. I think the countryside is better for small children, as they have more space and fresh air.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the changes she made in her room. What changes did you make in your room? Did you choose the colours yourself? Do you like the result?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Toys and younger children","id":25,"name":"Pete","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"My younger brother makes unbelievable things with his LEGO blocks.","q":[{"t":"What kind of toys did you play with when you were young?","k":"past","d":false},{"t":"What amazes you most in young kids today?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"How do you and your friends get along with younger brothers and sisters?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"his trip","trig":"I had a wonderful trip to Florida","tt":"past","ans":["When I was young, I played with building blocks, dolls, puzzles and board games.","What amazes me most in young kids today is how quickly they learn to use technology.","My friends and I usually get along well with younger brothers and sisters, although they can be noisy."],"ask":["Where did you go in Florida?","Who travelled with you?","What did you enjoy most during the trip?"],"model":"Dear Pete,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. When I was young, I played with building blocks, dolls, puzzles and board games. What amazes me most in young kids today is how quickly they learn to use technology. My friends and I usually get along well with younger brothers and sisters, although they can be noisy.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your trip. Where did you go in Florida? Who travelled with you? What did you enjoy most during the trip?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Cooking","id":26,"name":"Mary","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I am learning to cook from my mother now. But I prefer eating out.","q":[{"t":"There are so many cafés around, why should one cook at home?","k":"opinion","d":true},{"t":"What about you – what are your preferences and why?","k":"habit","d":true},{"t":"Do you ever cook for yourself or for the family?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"the book","trig":"I am learning Russian now and I’ve started reading a very interesting book in Russian","tt":"present","ans":["I prefer home-made food because it is healthier and usually cheaper than eating out.","However, I enjoy going to cafés with friends when we want to celebrate something.","I sometimes cook for my family, especially simple dishes like pasta, pancakes or salads."],"ask":["What Russian book are you reading?","Is it difficult for you?","Who is your favourite character?"],"model":"Dear Mary,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you, and I hope you are doing well.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I prefer home-made food because it is healthier and usually cheaper than eating out. However, I enjoy going to cafés with friends when we want to celebrate something. I sometimes cook for my family, especially simple dishes like pasta, pancakes or salads.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the book. What Russian book are you reading? Is it difficult for you? Who is your favourite character?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Eating out","id":27,"name":"Carol","email":true,"subject":"","lead":"My friends and I enjoy eating out a lot. There are so many nice cafés around!","q":[{"t":"How often do you eat out?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Is eating out popular with young people in Russia, and why or why not?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"What traditional Russian dishes do you like?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"the hiking trip","trig":"I’ve just returned from a hiking trip","tt":"past","ans":["I eat out about once or twice a month, usually with my friends after school.","Eating out is popular with young people in Russia because cafés are comfortable places to meet and talk.","I like traditional Russian dishes such as borscht, blini and pelmeni."],"ask":["Where did you go hiking?","How long did the trip last?","What was the most beautiful place on the route?"],"model":"Dear Carol,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I eat out about once or twice a month, usually with my friends after school. Eating out is popular with young people in Russia because cafés are comfortable places to meet and talk. I like traditional Russian dishes such as borscht, blini and pelmeni.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the hiking trip. Where did you go hiking? How long did the trip last? What was the most beautiful place on the route?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Eating habits","id":28,"name":"Mary","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I never eat breakfast, just like my mother.","q":[{"t":"Do you have any special eating habits and what are they?","k":"habit","d":true},{"t":"What do you usually have for lunch at school?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Can you give me the recipe of the dish you often cook yourself?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"the zoo","trig":"Last Saturday our family went to the zoo","tt":"past","ans":["I try to eat breakfast every day and drink enough water, though I sometimes eat sweets.","For lunch at school, I usually have soup, a main course and tea.","A simple dish I often cook is an omelette: you need eggs, milk, salt and cheese."],"ask":["Which zoo did your family visit?","What animals did you see?","Did you take any photos there?"],"model":"Dear Mary,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I try to eat breakfast every day and drink enough water, though I sometimes eat sweets. For lunch at school, I usually have soup, a main course and tea. A simple dish I often cook is an omelette: you need eggs, milk, salt and cheese.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the zoo. Which zoo did your family visit? What animals did you see? Did you take any photos there?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Reading preferences","id":29,"name":"Kevin","email":true,"subject":"Reading preferences","lead":"Last week I went to a book festival. It was fantastic! We spent two hours looking through new books and talking to authors.","q":[{"t":"What is the last book you’ve read?","k":"past","d":false},{"t":"What books do you have to read for your literature classes?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"How often do you spend time reading a book for pleasure?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"the film","trig":"I saw an interesting film in Spanish last week","tt":"past","ans":["The last book I read was a detective story, and I liked its unexpected ending.","For literature classes, we usually read Russian classics, poems and short stories.","I read books for pleasure several times a week when I have no urgent homework."],"ask":["What was the Spanish film about?","Did you understand it without subtitles?","Would you watch it again?"],"model":"Dear Kevin,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you, and I hope you are doing well.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. The last book I read was a detective story, and I liked its unexpected ending. For literature classes, we usually read Russian classics, poems and short stories. I read books for pleasure several times a week when I have no urgent homework.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the film. What was the Spanish film about? Did you understand it without subtitles? Would you watch it again?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Russian literature","id":30,"name":"Oscar","email":true,"subject":"Russian literature","lead":"As you know, I love reading, and I am into Russian literature now.","q":[{"t":"What Russian writers are most popular with Russian teenagers?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What is your favourite writer?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What is the first Russian book that a foreigner should read and why?","k":"opinion","d":true}],"about":"the present","trig":"By the way, I've got an unusual present","tt":"past","ans":["Pushkin, Tolstoy and Dostoevsky are among the most popular Russian writers with teenagers.","My favourite writer is Anton Chekhov because his short stories are clever and easy to discuss.","I would advise a foreigner to start with Pushkin’s short stories because they show Russian culture clearly."],"ask":["What present did you get?","Who gave it to you?","Why was it unusual?"],"model":"Dear Oscar,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you, and I hope you are doing well.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Pushkin, Tolstoy and Dostoevsky are among the most popular Russian writers with teenagers. My favourite writer is Anton Chekhov because his short stories are clever and easy to discuss. I would advise a foreigner to start with Pushkin’s short stories because they show Russian culture clearly.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the present. What present did you get? Who gave it to you? Why was it unusual?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Reading","id":31,"name":"Alison","email":true,"subject":"","lead":"Most of my friends enjoy reading books in their free time, and I like it too.","q":[{"t":"Is reading a popular hobby with teenagers in Russia?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What books do you read in your free time?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What book by a Russian writer would you advise me to read in the future, and why this one?","k":"would","d":true}],"about":"the school project","trig":"I’ve just finished my school project on history","tt":"past","ans":["Reading is quite popular with some Russian teenagers, especially those who enjoy fantasy and detective stories.","In my free time, I read modern novels, short stories and sometimes books in English.","I would advise you to read Pushkin’s The Captain’s Daughter because it is exciting and important for Russian culture."],"ask":["What period of history was your project about?","How long did you work on it?","Did your teacher like it?"],"model":"Dear Alison,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Reading is quite popular with some Russian teenagers, especially those who enjoy fantasy and detective stories. In my free time, I read modern novels, short stories and sometimes books in English. I would advise you to read Pushkin’s The Captain’s Daughter because it is exciting and important for Russian culture.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the school project. What period of history was your project about? How long did you work on it? Did your teacher like it?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Natural phenomena","id":32,"name":"Jerald","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"This summer we’ve had two tornadoes.","q":[{"t":"Why do you think some people “hunt” them, instead of hiding from them?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"What natural phenomena would you call the most dangerous for people, and why?","k":"would","d":true},{"t":"Will we ever learn to protect ourselves from them?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the basketball game","trig":"Yesterday I spent the whole evening watching a basketball game","tt":"past","ans":["Some people hunt tornadoes because they are interested in science and want to take rare photos.","I would call earthquakes the most dangerous natural phenomena because they happen suddenly and destroy buildings.","I think people will learn to predict many dangers better, but we will never control nature completely."],"ask":["Which teams played in the basketball game?","Who won the game?","Did you watch it alone or with friends?"],"model":"Dear Jerald,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Some people hunt tornadoes because they are interested in science and want to take rare photos. I would call earthquakes the most dangerous natural phenomena because they happen suddenly and destroy buildings. I think people will learn to predict many dangers better, but we will never control nature completely.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the basketball game. Which teams played in the basketball game? Who won the game? Did you watch it alone or with friends?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Money","id":33,"name":"Dan","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I earned my first money!","q":[{"t":"How do Russian teenagers earn their pocket money?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What part-time jobs are popular among them?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"In which sphere would you like to try your hand and why?","k":"would","d":true}],"about":"the book he started reading","trig":"I’ve started reading a book in French","tt":"present","ans":["Russian teenagers earn pocket money by babysitting, tutoring younger children, walking dogs or helping parents.","Popular part-time jobs include working as couriers, shop assistants and camp helpers.","I would like to try my hand in education because I enjoy explaining things to other people."],"ask":["What is the French book about?","Is it difficult to read in French?","Why did you choose this book?"],"model":"Dear Dan,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Russian teenagers earn pocket money by babysitting, tutoring younger children, walking dogs or helping parents. Popular part-time jobs include working as couriers, shop assistants and camp helpers. I would like to try my hand in education because I enjoy explaining things to other people.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the book he started reading. What is the French book about? Is it difficult to read in French? Why did you choose this book?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Foreign languages","id":34,"name":"Marion","email":true,"subject":"Foreign languages","lead":"They say that Russian students can choose a foreign language to study at school.","q":[{"t":"Do many students choose other languages instead of English?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"Why do you think they do so?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Why have you chosen English?","k":"past","d":false}],"about":"the book she has just finished reading","trig":"I’ve just finished reading a collection of Anton Chekhov’s short stories","tt":"past","ans":["Some Russian students choose German, French, Spanish or Chinese instead of English, but English is still the most common language.","They do so because they like the culture or need the language for future studies.","I have chosen English because it is useful for travelling, exams and communication."],"ask":["Which Chekhov story did you like most?","Was it difficult to understand?","Would you like to read more Russian literature?"],"model":"Dear Marion,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Some Russian students choose German, French, Spanish or Chinese instead of English, but English is still the most common language. They do so because they like the culture or need the language for future studies. I have chosen English because it is useful for travelling, exams and communication.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the book she has just finished reading. Which Chekhov story did you like most? Was it difficult to understand? Would you like to read more Russian literature?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Foreign languages and Chinese","id":35,"name":"Oscar","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I want to speak Chinese and I’ve joined an online language course.","q":[{"t":"Do many Russian teenagers learn foreign languages?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"Which foreign languages are popular with Russian young adults today?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"Which foreign language besides English would you like to study and why?","k":"would","d":true}],"about":"the new flat","trig":"By the way, we’ve just moved to a new flat","tt":"present","ans":["Many Russian teenagers learn foreign languages because they need them for exams, travel and future jobs.","English, Chinese, German, French and Spanish are popular with young adults today.","Besides English, I would like to study Chinese because it may be useful for business and travel."],"ask":["Where is your new flat?","Is it bigger than the old one?","Do you have your own room there?"],"model":"Dear Oscar,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Many Russian teenagers learn foreign languages because they need them for exams, travel and future jobs. English, Chinese, German, French and Spanish are popular with young adults today. Besides English, I would like to study Chinese because it may be useful for business and travel.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the new flat. Where is your new flat? Is it bigger than the old one? Do you have your own room there?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Online language learning","id":36,"name":"Oscar","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I want to speak Japanese and I’ve joined an online language course.","q":[{"t":"Do many Russian teenagers learn foreign languages online? Why or why not?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"What foreign languages are popular among them today?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What foreign language besides English would you like to study and why?","k":"would","d":true}],"about":"the Japanese lesson","trig":"Yesterday I had my first lesson of Japanese","tt":"past","ans":["Many Russian teenagers learn foreign languages online because it is convenient and often cheaper than regular courses.","English, Chinese, Korean, German and Spanish are popular among them today.","Besides English, I would like to study Japanese because I am interested in Japanese culture and films."],"ask":["How was your first Japanese lesson?","What words did you learn?","Was the teacher friendly?"],"model":"Dear Oscar,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Many Russian teenagers learn foreign languages online because it is convenient and often cheaper than regular courses. English, Chinese, Korean, German and Spanish are popular among them today. Besides English, I would like to study Japanese because I am interested in Japanese culture and films.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the Japanese lesson. How was your first Japanese lesson? What words did you learn? Was the teacher friendly?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Summer weather","id":37,"name":"Molly","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"This year we had an unusually hot summer.","q":[{"t":"What’s the weather normally like in summer in Russia?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What do you think about spending summer holidays at home?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"What is your favourite season, and why?","k":"habit","d":true}],"about":"the book","trig":"I’m reading a very interesting book about England in the 16th century","tt":"present","ans":["In Russia, summer weather depends on the region, but it is often warm and sometimes hot.","I think spending summer holidays at home can be nice if you have good plans and friends nearby.","My favourite season is autumn because the weather is fresh and the colours are beautiful."],"ask":["What is the book about?","Why did you choose a book about England?","Is it easy to read?"],"model":"Dear Molly,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. In Russia, summer weather depends on the region, but it is often warm and sometimes hot. I think spending summer holidays at home can be nice if you have good plans and friends nearby. My favourite season is autumn because the weather is fresh and the colours are beautiful.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the book. What is the book about? Why did you choose a book about England? Is it easy to read?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Rainy summer","id":38,"name":"Cyril","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"We had an awful summer this year.","q":[{"t":"What was the weather like in the place where you spent your summer this year?","k":"past","d":false},{"t":"What do you do on rainy days in summer?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What is your favourite season and why?","k":"habit","d":true}],"about":"his history class","trig":"Our history class this year is just fantastic!","tt":"present","ans":["The weather was warm but rainy in the place where I spent my summer this year.","On rainy days, I usually read, watch films or invite a friend to play board games.","My favourite season is summer because I have more free time and can travel."],"ask":["What topics do you study in history class?","Why is the class fantastic?","Do you like your history teacher?"],"model":"Dear Cyril,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. The weather was warm but rainy in the place where I spent my summer this year. On rainy days, I usually read, watch films or invite a friend to play board games. My favourite season is summer because I have more free time and can travel.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your history class. What topics do you study in history class? Why is the class fantastic? Do you like your history teacher?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Bad weather","id":39,"name":"Joan","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"When I forget to take an umbrella in summer, it always rains.","q":[{"t":"What’s the weather like in summer where you live?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What do you usually do when it rains?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"How do you protect yourself from bad weather?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"her new shoes","trig":"I bought new shoes two days ago, but now I think I should take them back to the store","tt":"past","ans":["Summer where I live is usually warm, but rainy days are quite common.","When it rains, I stay at home, read books or watch something interesting online.","I protect myself from bad weather by taking an umbrella and wearing waterproof shoes."],"ask":["Why do you want to take the shoes back?","Where did you buy them?","Do you have the receipt?"],"model":"Dear Joan,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Summer where I live is usually warm, but rainy days are quite common. When it rains, I stay at home, read books or watch something interesting online. I protect myself from bad weather by taking an umbrella and wearing waterproof shoes.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your new shoes. Why do you want to take the shoes back? Where did you buy them? Do you have the receipt?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Profession and future plans","id":40,"name":"Susan","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I would like to become a journalist.","q":[{"t":"What profession would you like to go into? Why?","k":"would","d":true},{"t":"What skills or knowledge does one need for it?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"How important for you is your parents’ opinion of your choice?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the exhibition","trig":"Last weekend my friends and I visited an arts exhibition in our local museum","tt":"past","ans":["I would like to become a teacher because I enjoy languages and working with people.","This profession requires patience, good communication skills and strong knowledge of the subject.","My parents’ opinion is important to me, but the final choice should be mine."],"ask":["What kind of exhibition did you visit?","Where was it held?","What artwork impressed you most?"],"model":"Dear Susan,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you, and I hope you are doing well.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I would like to become a teacher because I enjoy languages and working with people. This profession requires patience, good communication skills and strong knowledge of the subject. My parents’ opinion is important to me, but the final choice should be mine.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the exhibition. What kind of exhibition did you visit? Where was it held? What artwork impressed you most?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Future plans","id":41,"name":"James","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"My parents want me to follow in their footsteps and become a doctor. But my dream is to study maths.","q":[{"t":"What would you advise me to do?","k":"would","d":false},{"t":"What are your plans after you leave school?","k":"future","d":false},{"t":"Do your parents support you in your decision?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"the puppy","trig":"My parents bought me a puppy for my birthday!","tt":"present","ans":["I would advise you to talk honestly with your parents and explain why maths is important to you.","After I leave school, I plan to enter university and study foreign languages or education.","My parents support my decision because they want me to choose something I really like."],"ask":["What is your puppy’s name?","What breed is it?","Who usually takes care of it?"],"model":"Dear James,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I would advise you to talk honestly with your parents and explain why maths is important to you. After I leave school, I plan to enter university and study foreign languages or education. My parents support my decision because they want me to choose something I really like.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the puppy. What is your puppy’s name? What breed is it? Who usually takes care of it?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Russian traditions","id":42,"name":"Kelly","email":true,"subject":"Russian traditions","lead":"They say that Russian New Year traditions are unique.","q":[{"t":"How do Russians celebrate the New Year?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What are some special New Year dishes?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"How does your family celebrate the New Year?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"her decision to start learning Russian","trig":"I’ve decided to start learning Russian","tt":"future","ans":["Russians usually celebrate the New Year with family, a decorated tree, presents and a festive dinner.","Special New Year dishes include Olivier salad, herring under a fur coat and tangerines.","My family celebrates the New Year at home, watches TV, gives presents and goes outside after midnight."],"ask":["Why did you decide to learn Russian?","Are you going to take a course?","What Russian words do you already know?"],"model":"Dear Kelly,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Russians usually celebrate the New Year with family, a decorated tree, presents and a festive dinner. Special New Year dishes include Olivier salad, herring under a fur coat and tangerines. My family celebrates the New Year at home, watches TV, gives presents and goes outside after midnight.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your decision to start learning Russian. Why did you decide to learn Russian? Are you going to take a course? What Russian words do you already know?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Russian science","id":43,"name":"Chris","email":true,"subject":"","lead":"Yesterday our school teacher told us a lot about Russian scientific inventions.","q":[{"t":"What is the most famous Russian invention?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"Why is it important to study science at school?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"What Russian scientist do you think a foreigner should learn about, and why?","k":"opinion","d":true}],"about":"the present","trig":"I’ve just bought a present for my brother","tt":"past","ans":["One of the most famous Russian inventions is radio, which is connected with Alexander Popov.","It is important to study science at school because it develops logical thinking and helps us understand the world.","A foreigner should learn about Dmitri Mendeleev because he created the periodic table of elements."],"ask":["What present did you buy for your brother?","Why did you choose it?","When are you going to give it to him?"],"model":"Dear Chris,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. One of the most famous Russian inventions is radio, which is connected with Alexander Popov. It is important to study science at school because it develops logical thinking and helps us understand the world. A foreigner should learn about Dmitri Mendeleev because he created the periodic table of elements.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the present. What present did you buy for your brother? Why did you choose it? When are you going to give it to him?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Russian cuisine","id":44,"name":"Alice","email":true,"subject":"","lead":"Our school teacher asked us to do a project on national dishes of different countries. I want to write about the Russian cuisine.","q":[{"t":"What traditional dishes are popular in your country?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What national dish is the easiest to cook?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What ingredients are needed to cook it?","k":"country","d":false}],"about":"the singing lessons","trig":"I want to start taking singing lessons","tt":"future","ans":["Popular traditional Russian dishes are borscht, pelmeni, blini and shchi.","The easiest national dish to cook is blini because the recipe is simple and the ingredients are common.","To cook blini, you need flour, milk, eggs, sugar, salt and a little oil."],"ask":["Why do you want to take singing lessons?","Where will you have them?","How often will the lessons be?"],"model":"Dear Alice,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Popular traditional Russian dishes are borscht, pelmeni, blini and shchi. The easiest national dish to cook is blini because the recipe is simple and the ingredients are common. To cook blini, you need flour, milk, eggs, sugar, salt and a little oil.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the singing lessons. Why do you want to take singing lessons? Where will you have them? How often will the lessons be?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Computer games","id":45,"name":"Simon","email":true,"subject":"Computer games","lead":"I know that the Russian team won The International 10 – world cyber sport championship in 2021.","q":[{"t":"What computer games are most popular with Russian teenagers?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"How much time do you and your friends spend playing computer games?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What else do you use your computer for?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"his school sports club","trig":"I spend too much time surfing the internet and I’m thinking of joining our school sports club","tt":"future","ans":["Popular computer games with Russian teenagers include Minecraft, Dota 2, Counter-Strike and different mobile games.","My friends and I spend about two or three hours a week playing computer games.","I also use my computer for studying, watching videos, preparing presentations and talking to friends."],"ask":["What sports does your school sports club offer?","When are you going to join it?","How often will you train there?"],"model":"Dear Simon,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Popular computer games with Russian teenagers include Minecraft, Dota 2, Counter-Strike and different mobile games. My friends and I spend about two or three hours a week playing computer games. I also use my computer for studying, watching videos, preparing presentations and talking to friends.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your school sports club. What sports does your school sports club offer? When are you going to join it? How often will you train there?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Theatre and computer game","id":46,"name":"Jack","email":true,"subject":"","lead":"My friends and I regularly go to the theatre.","q":[{"t":"Is it popular with teenagers to go to the theatre in your country?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"Are you a theatregoer?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Who is your favourite Russian playwright, and why?","k":"habit","d":true}],"about":"the computer game","trig":"I’ve bought a new computer game","tt":"present","ans":["Going to the theatre is not very popular with all teenagers in Russia, but some students enjoy it.","I am not a real theatregoer, though I sometimes go to performances with my class.","My favourite Russian playwright is Anton Chekhov because his plays show people’s feelings in a deep way."],"ask":["What is your new computer game called?","What genre is it?","Do you play it alone or with friends?"],"model":"Dear Jack,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Going to the theatre is not very popular with all teenagers in Russia, but some students enjoy it. I am not a real theatregoer, though I sometimes go to performances with my class. My favourite Russian playwright is Anton Chekhov because his plays show people’s feelings in a deep way.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the computer game. What is your new computer game called? What genre is it? Do you play it alone or with friends?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Free time","id":47,"name":"Bob","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"All my days, including weekends look almost alike.","q":[{"t":"How do you spend your free time?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Where do you usually go with your friends?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What do your parents think about your friends?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"his project","trig":"Next week I’m presenting my project in history","tt":"future","ans":["I spend my free time reading, walking, watching films and chatting with my friends.","With my friends, I usually go to parks, cafés, shopping centres or the cinema.","My parents think my friends are polite and reliable, so they do not mind us spending time together."],"ask":["What is your history project about?","How long will your presentation be?","Are you nervous about presenting it?"],"model":"Dear Bob,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I spend my free time reading, walking, watching films and chatting with my friends. With my friends, I usually go to parks, cafés, shopping centres or the cinema. My parents think my friends are polite and reliable, so they do not mind us spending time together.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your project. What is your history project about? How long will your presentation be? Are you nervous about presenting it?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Leisure and reading","id":48,"name":"Peter","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"Reading books is my favourite pastime.","q":[{"t":"Is reading important to you? Why?","k":"habit","d":true},{"t":"How do you like to spend your leisure time?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What is your parents’ attitude to your hobbies and interests?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"his father’s birthday","trig":"Yesterday was my father’s birthday","tt":"past","ans":["Reading is important to me because it helps me relax and learn new ideas.","I also like spending my leisure time listening to music, walking and meeting friends.","My parents support my hobbies because they think hobbies make life more interesting."],"ask":["How old is your father?","What present did you give him?","How did your family celebrate his birthday?"],"model":"Dear Peter,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you, and I hope you are doing well.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Reading is important to me because it helps me relax and learn new ideas. I also like spending my leisure time listening to music, walking and meeting friends. My parents support my hobbies because they think hobbies make life more interesting.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your father’s birthday. How old is your father? What present did you give him? How did your family celebrate his birthday?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Sport","id":49,"name":"Adam","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"My sister and I want to learn how to windsurf.","q":[{"t":"What sport activities are popular with Russian teenagers?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"Do they differ from region to region?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"Would you like to take up some extreme sports, and why yes or no?","k":"would","d":true}],"about":"the audiobooks","trig":"By the way, I became keen on listening to audiobooks","tt":"present","ans":["Football, basketball, volleyball, swimming and skiing are popular with Russian teenagers.","Sports can differ from region to region because climate and facilities are not the same everywhere.","I would like to try an extreme sport, such as snowboarding, because it looks exciting and challenging."],"ask":["What audiobooks do you listen to?","Who is your favourite narrator?","When do you usually listen to them?"],"model":"Dear Adam,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Football, basketball, volleyball, swimming and skiing are popular with Russian teenagers. Sports can differ from region to region because climate and facilities are not the same everywhere. I would like to try an extreme sport, such as snowboarding, because it looks exciting and challenging.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the audiobooks. What audiobooks do you listen to? Who is your favourite narrator? When do you usually listen to them?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"PE and after-class activities","id":50,"name":"Dave","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"Our PE teacher is super! He lets us play different ball games and sports during the lessons.","q":[{"t":"Do you like your PE classes, and why?","k":"habit","d":true},{"t":"What sports and games can you play at school?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What after-class activities are most popular in your school?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"the family picnic","trig":"Last week my Dad organized a picnic for all our family","tt":"past","ans":["I like my PE classes because they help me move more and take a break from academic subjects.","At school we can play volleyball, basketball, football and table tennis.","The most popular after-class activities in my school are sports clubs, dance classes and English clubs."],"ask":["Where did your family have the picnic?","What food did your dad prepare?","Did the weather stay good?"],"model":"Dear Dave,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I like my PE classes because they help me move more and take a break from academic subjects. At school we can play volleyball, basketball, football and table tennis. The most popular after-class activities in my school are sports clubs, dance classes and English clubs.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the family picnic. Where did your family have the picnic? What food did your dad prepare? Did the weather stay good?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Inventions","id":51,"name":"Mark","email":true,"subject":"Inventions","lead":"Last week we went to the science museum in Chicago with my classmates. We learned a lot about modern inventions.","q":[{"t":"What is the most useful modern invention in your opinion?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"What museums do you like going to, if any?","k":"future","d":true},{"t":"How often do you go on excursions to museums with your classmates?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"his group project","trig":"I spent hours working on a group project last week","tt":"past","ans":["The most useful modern invention, in my opinion, is the smartphone because it combines communication, study and entertainment.","I like going to science and history museums because they make facts easier to understand.","My classmates and I go on museum excursions a few times a year."],"ask":["What was your group project about?","Who worked with you?","Did you get a good mark?"],"model":"Dear Mark,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. The most useful modern invention, in my opinion, is the smartphone because it combines communication, study and entertainment. I like going to science and history museums because they make facts easier to understand. My classmates and I go on museum excursions a few times a year.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your group project. What was your group project about? Who worked with you? Did you get a good mark?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Dreams","id":52,"name":"Nora","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"My mom says I have too many dreams.","q":[{"t":"What kind of dreams do you have?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What personal qualities do you need to realise your wishes?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Do you tell anyone about your dreams, why yes or no?","k":"habit","d":true}],"about":"her elder brother","trig":"Last weekend my elder brother went hiking","tt":"past","ans":["I have dreams about travelling, getting a good education and doing a job I enjoy.","To realise your wishes, you need patience, confidence, discipline and the ability to work hard.","I tell my family about some of my dreams because their support helps me move forward."],"ask":["Where did your elder brother go hiking?","Who went with him?","Did he enjoy the route?"],"model":"Dear Nora,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I have dreams about travelling, getting a good education and doing a job I enjoy. To realise your wishes, you need patience, confidence, discipline and the ability to work hard. I tell my family about some of my dreams because their support helps me move forward.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your elder brother. Where did your elder brother go hiking? Who went with him? Did he enjoy the route?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Family","id":53,"name":"Harley","email":true,"subject":"Family","lead":"For the first time in my life, I’ve participated in a school swimming competition, and my family supported me so much!","q":[{"t":"What’s the best thing about your family?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What do you usually talk to your parents about?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"Do you prefer spending your free time with family or friends and why?","k":"habit","d":true}],"about":"the summer arts camp","trig":"I’m going to a summer arts camp in August","tt":"future","ans":["The best thing about my family is that we support each other in difficult situations.","I usually talk to my parents about school, friends, plans and everyday problems.","I prefer spending my free time with both family and friends because they give me different kinds of support."],"ask":["Where will the arts camp be?","How long will you stay there?","What art activities are you going to try?"],"model":"Dear Harley,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. The best thing about my family is that we support each other in difficult situations. I usually talk to my parents about school, friends, plans and everyday problems. I prefer spending my free time with both family and friends because they give me different kinds of support.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the summer arts camp. Where will the arts camp be? How long will you stay there? What art activities are you going to try?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Food","id":54,"name":"Oscar","email":true,"subject":"Food","lead":"My mom decided that now we have to eat only healthy food, and I totally agree with her!","q":[{"t":"What do you eat for breakfast?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What is your favourite food?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What do you think about fast food?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the book","trig":"Yesterday I started reading a book about happiness","tt":"past","ans":["For breakfast, I usually eat porridge or eggs and drink tea.","My favourite food is pasta because it is tasty, simple and easy to cook.","I think fast food is okay sometimes, but eating it too often is unhealthy."],"ask":["What is the book about?","Why did you choose a book about happiness?","Has it changed your mood?"],"model":"Dear Oscar,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you, and I hope you are doing well.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. For breakfast, I usually eat porridge or eggs and drink tea. My favourite food is pasta because it is tasty, simple and easy to cook. I think fast food is okay sometimes, but eating it too often is unhealthy.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the book. What is the book about? Why did you choose a book about happiness? Has it changed your mood?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Grocery shopping","id":55,"name":"Max","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"Last week it was my sister’s turn to go to the grocery store. For three days we had nothing to eat but frozen vegetables. Yucky.","q":[{"t":"Who and how often buys food in your family?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What kind of food do you usually have at home?","k":"habit","d":false},{"t":"What do you think about your local grocery food stores?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the trip","trig":"Our teacher is planning a school trip to the national park","tt":"future","ans":["In my family, my parents usually buy food twice a week, and I sometimes help them.","We usually have vegetables, fruit, bread, dairy products, pasta and some meat at home.","My local grocery stores are quite good, though prices have become higher."],"ask":["Where is the national park?","When is your class going there?","What activities has your teacher planned?"],"model":"Dear Max,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you, and I hope you are doing well.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. In my family, my parents usually buy food twice a week, and I sometimes help them. We usually have vegetables, fruit, bread, dairy products, pasta and some meat at home. My local grocery stores are quite good, though prices have become higher.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the trip. Where is the national park? When is your class going there? What activities has your teacher planned?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Food preferences","id":56,"name":"Sandra","email":true,"subject":"Food preferences","lead":"Nowadays I always try to eat healthy food. But in the past, I used to love sweets and fast food very much.","q":[{"t":"What kind of food do Russian people eat most often?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"How have your food preferences changed since you were a kid?","k":"past","d":false},{"t":"Do you think your food preferences will continue to change as you get older, why or why not?","k":"future","d":true}],"about":"her letters to Santa","trig":"My family and I still write letters to Santa at Christmas","tt":"present","ans":["Russian people often eat soups, potatoes, meat, fish, salads, bread and dairy products.","Since I was a kid, I have started eating more vegetables and less sweets.","I think my food preferences will continue to change because people’s tastes and health needs change with age."],"ask":["Do you still write letters to Santa every year?","What do you usually ask for?","Who keeps this family tradition alive?"],"model":"Dear Sandra,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Russian people often eat soups, potatoes, meat, fish, salads, bread and dairy products. Since I was a kid, I have started eating more vegetables and less sweets. I think my food preferences will continue to change because people’s tastes and health needs change with age.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your letters to Santa. Do you still write letters to Santa every year? What do you usually ask for? Who keeps this family tradition alive?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"Camping","id":57,"name":"Emily","email":true,"subject":"Camping","lead":"All of my friends think camping is a perfect way to spend the holidays.","q":[{"t":"What is your attitude to camping?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Is it popular with Russian teenagers, and why or why not?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"What are the best ways to spend the holidays for you and your friends?","k":"habit","d":false}],"about":"the TV show","trig":"I’ve just started watching an interesting TV show","tt":"present","ans":["I have a positive attitude to camping because it helps people enjoy nature and forget about gadgets for a while.","It is fairly popular with Russian teenagers, especially in summer camps and hiking clubs.","For me and my friends, the best holidays include travelling, swimming, walking and spending time together."],"ask":["What is the TV show called?","What is it about?","Would you recommend it to me?"],"model":"Dear Emily,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I have a positive attitude to camping because it helps people enjoy nature and forget about gadgets for a while. It is fairly popular with Russian teenagers, especially in summer camps and hiking clubs. For me and my friends, the best holidays include travelling, swimming, walking and spending time together.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the TV show. What is the TV show called? What is it about? Would you recommend it to me?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Work or study","id":58,"name":"Sam","email":true,"subject":"Work or study","lead":"I really don’t know whether to enter a college or to start working after finishing school.","q":[{"t":"What are your plans?","k":"future","d":false},{"t":"Do many Russian school-leavers continue their education in universities, why?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"Where can a teenager work in Russia after finishing school?","k":"country","d":false}],"about":"his sister’s wedding","trig":"My elder sister is getting married next week, it will be a big wedding","tt":"future","ans":["After finishing school, I plan to enter university because I want to get a good profession.","Many Russian school-leavers continue their education at universities because higher education gives more career opportunities.","A teenager in Russia can work as a courier, shop assistant, waiter or camp helper."],"ask":["Where will your sister’s wedding take place?","How many guests will come?","What are you going to wear?"],"model":"Dear Sam,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. After finishing school, I plan to enter university because I want to get a good profession. Many Russian school-leavers continue their education at universities because higher education gives more career opportunities. A teenager in Russia can work as a courier, shop assistant, waiter or camp helper.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about your sister’s wedding. Where will your sister’s wedding take place? How many guests will come? What are you going to wear?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Dacha","id":59,"name":"Bob","email":false,"subject":"","lead":"I know many people in Russia have dachas.","q":[{"t":"Why do people want to have a dacha?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"What do they usually do there?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"How do people usually get there?","k":"country","d":false}],"about":"the school dancing class","trig":"I’ve decided to join our school dancing class","tt":"future","ans":["Many Russians want to have a dacha because it is a quiet place to rest outside the city.","They usually grow vegetables, have barbecues, repair the house and spend time with relatives there.","People usually get to their dachas by car, bus or train."],"ask":["Why did you decide to join the dancing class?","What dances will you learn?","How often will you have classes?"],"model":"Dear Bob,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. Many Russians want to have a dacha because it is a quiet place to rest outside the city. They usually grow vegetables, have barbecues, repair the house and spend time with relatives there. People usually get to their dachas by car, bus or train.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the school dancing class. Why did you decide to join the dancing class? What dances will you learn? How often will you have classes?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"History of Russia","id":60,"name":"Patrick","email":true,"subject":"A lesson to remember","lead":"At school we talked about the events in the history of our country that we can be proud of.","q":[{"t":"What is the event in the history of Russia that you are most proud of?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"What historical person do you think best represents the values of your country?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Why is it important to know the history of your country?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the local environment protection organizations","trig":"During the holidays my friends and I always help our local environment protection organizations","tt":"present","ans":["I am proud of the victory in the Great Patriotic War because it showed courage and unity.","I think Yuri Gagarin represents important values of my country because he was brave and inspired millions of people.","It is important to know history because it helps people understand their identity and avoid past mistakes."],"ask":["What organizations do your friends help?","What do you usually do for them?","How often do you volunteer?"],"model":"Dear Patrick,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. I am proud of the victory in the Great Patriotic War because it showed courage and unity. I think Yuri Gagarin represents important values of my country because he was brave and inspired millions of people. It is important to know history because it helps people understand their identity and avoid past mistakes.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the local environment protection organizations. What organizations do your friends help? What do you usually do for them? How often do you volunteer?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"his","topic":"Environment protection","id":61,"name":"Morris","email":true,"subject":"Environment protection","lead":"You know that I’ve always been involved in various environmental activities.","q":[{"t":"What are the environmental issues that are most pressing in Russia today?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What are the ways in which people in Russia try to protect the environment?","k":"country","d":false},{"t":"What else do you think people in your country can do to help protect the environment?","k":"opinion","d":false}],"about":"the documentary he liked","trig":"Yesterday I watched a very interesting documentary","tt":"past","ans":["The most pressing environmental issues in Russia are air pollution, rubbish, forest fires and water pollution.","People try to protect the environment by recycling, cleaning parks, planting trees and using public transport.","I think people could also use less plastic and save electricity more actively."],"ask":["What was the documentary about?","Why did you like it?","Would you recommend it to our class?"],"model":"Dear Morris,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. The most pressing environmental issues in Russia are air pollution, rubbish, forest fires and water pollution. People try to protect the environment by recycling, cleaning parks, planting trees and using public transport. I think people could also use less plastic and save electricity more actively.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the documentary you liked. What was the documentary about? Why did you like it? Would you recommend it to our class?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"},{"g":"her","topic":"St Petersburg","id":62,"name":"Olive","email":true,"subject":"St. Petersburg","lead":"At college we are doing projects on the historic cities of the world.","q":[{"t":"If I choose St. Petersburg in Russia, what places of interest should I write about?","k":"opinion","d":false},{"t":"Is St. Petersburg popular among foreign and local tourists, and why?","k":"country","d":true},{"t":"What season is the best to visit St. Petersburg?","k":"country","d":false}],"about":"the trip","trig":"We’ve just returned from the trip to the seaside","tt":"past","ans":["You should write about the Hermitage, Peterhof, St. Isaac’s Cathedral and the Peter and Paul Fortress.","St. Petersburg is popular with foreign and local tourists because it has beautiful architecture, museums and a special atmosphere.","The best season to visit St. Petersburg is summer because the weather is mild and visitors can enjoy the White Nights."],"ask":["Where did you go on your seaside trip?","How long did you stay there?","What did you enjoy most by the sea?"],"model":"Dear Olive,\n\nThanks for your message. It was great to hear from you.\n\nNow I’d like to answer your questions. You should write about the Hermitage, Peterhof, St. Isaac’s Cathedral and the Peter and Paul Fortress. St. Petersburg is popular with foreign and local tourists because it has beautiful architecture, museums and a special atmosphere. The best season to visit St. Petersburg is summer because the weather is mild and visitors can enjoy the White Nights.\n\nBy the way, I’d like to ask you some questions about the trip. Where did you go on your seaside trip? How long did you stay there? What did you enjoy most by the sea?\n\nWrite back soon.\nBest wishes,\nSasha"}];
